 A once-loyal wife with a hidden slutty side. Now trapped in NTR chaos and financial ruin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/50814e5fd21451d57ce0afe596513013.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Leza Boyle</strong> \u2013 A dominant businesswoman who uses sex, money, and toys to get what she wants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/dbf5568f8623e9bc8cef955b89a4acbc.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Nisha</strong> \u2013 A fit, street-smart alley girl who marries Weasel but harbors other cravings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/b64edcce58a3cd24dd14f55714c632c8.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Flecia</strong> \u2013 A nurse with secrets. The only one who knows the truth about George\u2026 and hides it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/6a6f9056490d68790403fa80fcb5eb81.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Sherry</strong> \u2013 A seductive brothel worker who plays her own game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/b6d7ba6fd2cdafeed0d965caff2e4568.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Maria</strong> \u2013 A rich and bratty woman who roams the arena. She\u2019s not impressed by you\u2014yet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Characters</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/8544ddbc600d21864c4eb95479ad8bc9.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>MC ([player name])</strong> \u2013 A rising MMA fighter uncovering the truth about his legendary father's disappearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/c419691d83b0497af7a8ebb5eeabdb82.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>George</strong> \u2013 MC\u2019s father, a respected fighter who mysteriously vanished after a brutal match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/6e22865bf2104ecb8e334c4252ef2b8a.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Dana Redd</strong> \u2013 A corrupt fight promoter who orchestrated George\u2019s downfall and exploits rising stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/ddb5c441809646bd1ead51f7125c0454.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Richard Manager</strong> \u2013 The new face of the arena, replacing Dana with his own secret motives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fighters &amp; Rivals</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/f4fd2d5a1b3fa355ce9e8efc8ba28cbe.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Konor</strong> \u2013 A brash, arrogant fighter who was crowned champion through Dana\u2019s favoritism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/772ed77a72c9a94524da480d1a2f5b58.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Sagot Chama</strong> \u2013 A Muay Thai beast involved in George\u2019s disappearance. Undefeated. Unforgiving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/608a63ed42e1cc17cecc67ecd85f3e05.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Rampage Mike</strong> \u2013 A loudmouth boxer who mocks MC and plays dirty in and out of the ring.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/4ba259aec7b89f28f177b90aed4556dd.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Rick Wild (Diamond Wild)</strong> \u2013 A raw brawler with something to prove and zero respect for rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/8334a29559325410f4f80ce838ccf157.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Weasel</strong> \u2013 Anna\u2019s awkward, milk-addicted son who dreams of strength but lacks brains (and shame).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/cab8352e4558e36c31c58b34355e8feb.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Bisping</strong> \u2013 Dana\u2019s son. Young, smug, and overconfident \u2014 a future threat to MC\u2019s rise.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Antagonists &amp; Manipulators</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/170e7642c31bab946c13e131cc29e076.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Harvey</strong> \u2013 A creepy Hollywood agent who manipulates Aniya with fake promises of stardom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/44560e20f9dd27418584bdac6e78a17e.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Diaz</strong> \u2013 Rose\u2019s furious ex-husband. His twisted revenge ruins her life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2655080/extras/3dcea172b89b633caaf96d90239fc308.avif?t=1753538907\" width=300 height=300 /></span><strong>Thug</strong> \u2013 A disgusting alley presence. Minor role, maximum sleaze.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MMA Life Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MMA Life Simulator</strong> is an <strong>adult visual novel</strong> blended with <strong>MMA fighting mechanics</strong>, <strong>interactive storytelling</strong>, and morally grey choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a rising fighter in a corrupt world where power, lust, and money decide who gets to stay on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight System</strong>: Train, level up, and defeat ranked fighters to dominate the arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Storyline</strong>: Discover the truth behind your father\u2019s fall and Dana\u2019s betrayal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erotic Content</strong>: Build sexual tension and unleash it across branching scenes with major female characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Business &amp; Money</strong>: Run Leza\u2019s shop, manage brothels, and make money from sex, fame, or fighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Choices</strong>: Your decisions impact relationships, sex paths, loyalty, and power plays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harem Progression</strong>: Turn your apartment into a den of loyalty, lust, or love\u2014with Anna, Nisha, and Aniya all living under one roof.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In MMA Life Simulator, strength alone isn\u2019t enough\u2014<strong>control is everything</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
